{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-08-05 03:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP ANNOUNCES Q4 2022 LAUNCH OF EUROPEAN OVERNIGHT INDEX FUTURES', 'text': "CHICAGO , AUG. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL LAUNCH EUROPEAN OVERNIGHT INDEX FUTURES BASED ON REPOFUNDS RATE (RFR) BENCHMARKS AND THE EURO SHORT-TERM RATE (€STR) IN Q4 2022, PENDING REGULATORY REVIEW. RFR FUTURES WILL BE CASH-SETTLED CONTRACTS BASED ON RFR BENCHMARKS, A ROBUST MEASURE OF OVERNIGHT FUNDING COSTS."}